  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "cli-health-and-models",
      "claim": "The version and health subcommands, the /health body and status, and the GET /v1/models envelope and filtering are unchanged. Every response, /health and /v1/models included, now also carries an X-Request-Id header. The CLI gains a credentials rekey subcommand; serve refuses to start when a configured credential encryption key does not match the key the database was encrypted with, which does not apply to a fresh state directory without a key, as the release smoke runs.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/cmd/llmgw/main.go, go/internal/api/request_id.go, go/internal/iam/credential_key.go and their tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "protocol-compatibility",
      "claim": "Streaming Messages requests whose targets all serve Messages natively are relayed as the upstream sent them, with the client's anthropic-version and anthropic-beta forwarded through llmgw-core v1.4.0; Chat Completions requests forward every client field to OpenAI-compatible targets and refuse, with 400 naming it, a field whose loss would change the answer on targets that cannot send it, while advisory fields are dropped as before.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/api/anthropic.go, go/internal/api/openai.go, go/internal/providers/anthropic.go, go/internal/providers/chat_fields.go and their tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "providers-and-routing",
      "claim": "Errors from companion-daemon providers take part in retry, circuit and failover; gateway-internal controls stay out of daemon requests; circuits are kept per credential scope; catalogs are written atomically and read from the cache on the request path with background refresh; the inert Copilot device-login routes are removed.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/providers/extension_failure.go, extension_vertical.go, policy.go, catalog.go, catalog_store.go, go/internal/router/failover.go, go/internal/api/server.go and their tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "governance-and-operations",
      "claim": "Provider, endpoint and OAuth configuration changes are audited with the acting administrator; a credential encryption key check value is stored and verified; the credential encryption key can be rotated offline with llmgw credentials rekey; every request has an ID carried by its usage records, request log entry and audit events.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/api/audit.go, go/internal/iam/rekey.go, go/internal/operations/rekey.go and their tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dependencies-and-ci",
      "claim": "go.mod requires llmgw-core v1.4.0, llm-translate v0.4.0, llm-provider-auth v1.0.1 and modernc.org/sqlite v1.60.1 with no replace directive; console and acceptance-harness npm dependencies and pinned actions move within their major versions; CI adds Windows and macOS tests of the platform-specific packages, a cross-compile of every release target, and staticcheck.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/go.mod, go/go.sum, go/internal/web/console/package-lock.json, test/live-acceptance/package-lock.json, .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/workflows/release.yml"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "release-gates",
      "claim": "At source revision ff4b62c492ab13bd78d00fb4c1dc9bd955e87b6f: go build, go vet, staticcheck, go test for every package, govulncheck, go mod tidy -diff and go mod verify pass; console typecheck, 154 tests, npm audit and the dist rebuild check pass; the documentation check and the acceptance-policy and roster script tests pass; go test -race over every package passes on linux/amd64 with Go 1.26.6; the deterministic Docker acceptance passes all 31 checks against an image built from that revision on a Linux engine, where its digest policy does not apply to a locally built candidate.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "local release-gate execution for ff4b62c492ab13bd78d00fb4c1dc9bd955e87b6f"
      }
    }
  ],
